{"title":"Pilot Captures Amazing Aurora Photos During Flight","link":"https://kottke.org/26/01/pilot-captures-amazing-aurora-photos-during-flight","date":1769107709000,"content":"\n         <img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48218-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48218-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48218-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48218-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48218-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48218-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" />\n\nThis week, the Earth was hit with one of the strongest geomagnetic storms in recent years, which made for some gobsmacking displays of the northern lights, even as far south as California. Cruising in a 787 at 37,000 feet on his route from Calgary to London (UK), airline pilot <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/matt_melnyk_photography\">Matt Melnyk</a> had perhaps the best view in the world of the aurora and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DTvJ84VEcU7/\">captured</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DTvKAvlkc_J/\">some</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DTvLNI0Edm8/\">fantastic</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DTvSJWHiB0q/\">shots</a>. He told <a href=\"https://www.space.com/stargazing/auroras/the-most-incredible-display-of-aurora-ive-ever-seen-in-my-20-years-of-flying-pilot-captures-historic-northern-lights-show-from-37-000-feet-photos\">space.com</a> that “This was the most incredible display of aurora I’ve ever seen in my 20 years of flying!” \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/astronomy\">astronomy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/flying\">flying</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Matt%20Melnyk\">Matt Melnyk</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/01/pilot-captures-amazing-aurora-photos-during-flight\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"c41d5ec59c7d61cb862826a399783c59576212bdee190e38da14134a84f3f0e6","category":"Sites"}